From: Nerves ROCK Pi S maintainers <noreply@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rock-s0: stabilize MMC numbering

Assign aliases to all three MMC controllers so asynchronous probe order cannot
swap the removable SD card and onboard eMMC device names. Nerves boot, update,
environment, and application-data paths expect the SD card at mmcblk2.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3308-rock-s0.dts | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3308-rock-s0.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3308-rock-s0.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3308-rock-s0.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3308-rock-s0.dts
@@ -14,0 +15,6 @@
+	aliases {
+		mmc0 = &sdio;
+		mmc1 = &emmc;
+		mmc2 = &sdmmc;
+	};
+
--
2.43.0
